This week, we are running the rules and testing that they are working. 

There are three Rego deny rules that we need to implement: 

SC-28: deny any bucket with no matching encryption configuration.

AC-3: deny any bucket whose public access block is missing or has any of its four flags not set to true.

CM-6: deny any taggable resource missing one of the four required tags.



Rego details: https://www.openpolicyagent.org/docs/policy-language

